# Trigger Selector (Frame Start)
# If the trigger is used, it uses Frame Start.
# The procedure is the following:
#   1. Select Frame Start in Trigger Selector.
#   2. Select Timed or Trigger Width in Exposure Mode.
#   3. Set ON in Trigger Mode.
#
#   Caution: For trigger operation, Exposure Mode must first be set to
#            something other than OFF and then Trigger Mode of Frame Start
#            must be ON.  If the Exposure Mode is set to OFF, the trigger mode
#            cannot be set.
